{"ticker":"LDOS","updated":"2026-11-14T01:10:52Z","profile":{"longName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.leidos.com","fullTimeEmployees":50000,"marketCap":15923968000,"trailingPE":11.66488,"forwardPE":11.059952,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.8948563,"pegRatio":2.46,"targetMeanPrice":153.46667,"targetHighPrice":225.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.036,"earningsGrowth":0.163,"grossMargins":0.17628999,"operatingMargins":0.1184,"profitMargins":0.07974,"totalRevenue":17795000320,"beta":0.544,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":205.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":98.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.31},"summary":"Leidos Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides services and solutions for government and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The National Security & Digital segment provides national security software; services by using artificial intelligence and machine learning to coordinate sea, ground, air, and space to help warfighters; offensive, defensive, and physical cyber operation solutions; intelligence analysis, operational support, logistics operations, security, linguistics, force production, biometrics, chemical, biological, radiological, nuclear, and explosives, energetics, training, and other services; and Digital Modernization and transformation services. The Health & Civil segment offers air traffic control systems; health mission software; managed health services; infrastructure management and operation; logistical operations and information technology support; and life science research and development support services. The Commercial & International segment provides power grid engineering and design, grid modernization, utility planning and consulting, energy management and efficiency, technology-driven innovation, and software and application development; people scanners, computed tomography carry-on baggage scanners, checked baggage scanners, and explosive trace detectors; mobile, non-intrusive ports and borders inspection sys","summary_zh":"Leidos Holdings, Inc. 及其子公司為美國和國際上的政府和商業客戶提供服務和解決方案。國家安全與數位部門提供國家安全軟體；透過使用人工智慧和機器學習來協調海上、地面、空中和太空來幫助作戰人員提供服務；進攻性、防禦性和物理網路作戰解決方案；情報分析、作戰支援、後勤作戰、安全、語言學、部隊生產、生物識別、化學、生物、放射性、核子與爆炸物、能量學、培訓和其他服務；以及現代化轉型和其他服務；健康與民用部門提供空中交通管制系統；健康使命軟體；管理衛生服務；基礎設施管理和運營；後勤運作和資訊技術支援；和生命科學研究和開發支援服務。商業和國際部門提供電網工程和設計、電網現代化、公用事業規劃和諮詢、能源管理和效率、技術驅動的創新以及軟體和應用程序開發；人員掃描儀、電腦斷層掃描隨身行李掃描儀、托運行李掃描儀和爆炸物微量探測器；移動、非侵入式港口和邊境檢查系統","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":182.26,"h":184.38,"l":181.84,"c":182.73,"v":746100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":182.56,"h":183.79,"l":180.84,"c":182.58,"v":904500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":182.59,"h":185.0,"l":181.08,"c":183.8,"v":710600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":183.31,"h":187.57,"l":181.29,"c":187.15,"v":832500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":187.76,"h":188.9,"l":186.51,"c":187.45,"v":3133100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":186.89,"h":188.28,"l":183.39,"c":187.87,"v":753600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":188.52,"h":190.68,"l":185.12,"c":187.11,"v":778700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":188.33,"h":189.21,"l":186.91,"c":187.4,"v":727300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":187.29,"h":188.37,"l":179.2,"c":182.36,"v":1041600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":183.35,"h":185.85,"l":181.44,"c":184.9,"v":838200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":186.22,"h":187.5,"l":184.09,"c":185.61,"v":846900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":186.21,"h":189.74,"l":186.06,"c":188.96,"v":844400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":186.81,"h":191.66,"l":186.81,"c":191.63,"v":956000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":191.25,"h":193.64,"l":190.06,"c":192.89,"v":744800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":192.81,"h":197.46,"l":192.0,"c":195.58,"v":868100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":195.58,"h":198.81,"l":195.0,"c":198.04,"v":885400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":198.95,"h":199.28,"l":196.39,"c":197.0,"v":669000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":198.0,"h":198.56,"l":195.64,"c":198.